#: scenario2:scenario2_D920D809_7AC7_4078_BA5E_44D102A69953
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55123a06a9f26f57fa3a1628b5197096bc6e2a9a5044ecfd99e3b243a9c4a6ee
